; expect 79
; A literal pattern used to be indistinguishable from a binder -
; `patHead` answered 0 for both - so `(1 42)` matched every scrutinee
; and the first literal arm swallowed the whole match.
; f(1)=42 lit, f(2)=7 lit, f(3)=30 binder arm; 42+7+30.
(:: f (-> Int Int))
(fn (f n) (match n (1 42) (2 7) (x (* x 10))))
(:: main Int)
(fn (main) (+ (f 1) (+ (f 2) (f 3))))
